<block><txt break.before="1">An Act relating to the service of process on
Sundays, and to repeal section 41 of the <legref refid="act-1969-030"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Imperial Acts
Application Act 1969</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fb7c456d-723d-4088-8d37-d625c277b8f4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_1ea2bd16-0ae4-4519-8e2b-fe5e2d73d16d"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1984-045" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Sunday (Service of Process) Act
1984</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bb514e6f-3d48-4fd4-8c1e-202b5557e426"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_0eaf2d6e-67e7-431a-b501-8f74ba0ffea8"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1dd855c1-ee9b-4453-8d3b-bb2b53f06074"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Sections 1 and 2 shall commence on the date of
assent to this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12eb29c1-5ed9-430d-a90f-e7ddce15872c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Except as provided by subsection (1), this Act
shall commence on such day as may be appointed by the Governor in respect
thereof and as may be notified by proclamation published in the
Gazette.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3e5adcaa-71dc-4f20-9f48-148ca3eef72e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_f1c6e55d-06d0-491f-b71e-ecc2911fcff5"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Service of process on a Sunday</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6efff526-8bc2-4f98-83c8-5d57081b9b0d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any writ, process, warrant, order, judgment or
decree may be served on a Sunday.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b9e5d0b7-850c-4f12-bc6f-0d9445a21dcb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notwithstanding subsection (1), service of any
writ, process, warrant, order, judgment or decree (except in the case of an
offence, breach of the peace or any warrant, writ or process for the
apprehension of any person or for the entry into or search of any premises) on
a Sunday on which Christmas Day falls shall be void.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1985 No 38,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c12fb133-a67d-4aa0-bcd3-71f4d2eb3888"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_ed64c930-caff-4df5-b0c4-78e6028bc2a2"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Amendment of Act No 30, 1969</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 41 of the <legref refid="act-1969-030"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Imperial Acts
Application Act 1969</i></name></legref> is repealed.</txt></block></level>
</content>


